              "actionableFix": "Create a protocol and analysis specification that defines the research question, model choice, variable coding, and diagnostics before re-running. Bind the run to these artifacts.",
              "reentryPoint": "protocol",
              "deterministicVerification": null,
              "confidence": 0.9
            },
            {
