              "actionableFix": "Add a likelihood ratio test comparing negative binomial to Poisson (test alpha=0). Report a GoF statistic (e.g., deviance, Pearson chi-square). Check for zero-inflation (e.g., Vuong test, zero-inflated model comparison). Provide residual diagnostic plots (e.g., randomized quantile residuals).",
